        2279,
        1892,
        2509
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "I have designated my assistant, Mrs. Anna Arnold Hedgeman, as Chairman of the Municipal Employees Group for The Greater New York Fund, and I ask that you give her the fullest measure of your support and assistance in making 1956 a most successful year for the Fund.",
